message: "If you use this code or data, please cite this repository."
title: "Finite-bandwidth quantum-jump timing: reproducibility code and numerical data"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Lyu
    given-names: Ruijie
    affiliation: University of Groningen
version: 1.2.1
date-released: 2026-09-07
url: "https://github.com/RyanLrj/finite-bandwidth-quantum-jump-timing"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RyanLrj/finite-bandwidth-quantum-jump-timing"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility code and numerical data for thermodynamic constraints on
  classical emulation of finite-bandwidth quantum-jump timing. The archive
  contains the finite-bandwidth trajectory models, fixed-resource classical
  optimizations, spectral and Fourier-witness audits, finite-sample
  calculations, detector post-processing tests, and figure-generation code.
keywords:
  - quantum trajectories
  - open quantum systems
  - quantum thermodynamics
  - finite-bandwidth detection
  - stochastic thermodynamics
  - reproducibility
